cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "LunarSims: browser simulations of lunar settlement"
abstract: >-
  Original browser simulation games set on the lunar surface, including
  Lunar Metropolis, an executable model of lunar settlement growth that
  couples an elevation field to a solar-exposure raycast and derives from
  it the distribution of water ice, the availability of solar power, and
  the economic value of ground. Three habitat strategies are represented:
  surface construction, arcologies bored into permanently shadowed ice,
  and arcologies extending along pre-existing lava tubes.
type: software
